CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785669498
OL,3,CTall ship replica to dock in
OL,4,CWhitehaven today
OL,6,FA replica 15th century tall ship is
OL,7,Fset to dock in Whitehaven today.
OL,9,FThe ship 'Nao Santa Maria' is a
OL,10,Freplica of the ship that Christopher
OL,11,FColumbus first used to sail to the
OL,12,FAmericas in 1492, and visitors will be
OL,13,Fable to explore its interior and learn
OL,14,Fabout life on board.
OL,16,FThe replica vessel is due to remain in
OL,17,FWhitehaven until Monday August 10,
OL,18,Fwhen it will make its way to
OL,19,FLiverpool, before docking in Barrow
OL,20,Flater that month.
OL,26,@qD@Xrt
