PN,32902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785669498
OL,3,CTall ship replica to dock in
OL,4,CWhitehaven today
OL,6,FGerard Richardson, deputy lieutenant
OL,7,Fof Cumbria, led the organisation of
OL,8,Fthe ship's visit.
OL,10,FHe said: "I think it's wonderful for
OL,11,Fthe town. Ships like this, they are
OL,12,Ffloating museums. They are created to
OL,13,Fbe exact replicas and have all the
OL,14,Ftalking points and display boards
OL,15,Fexplaining its history.
OL,17,F"For a week or so it's like adding a
OL,18,Fthird tourist attraction to the town.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,330,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785669498
OL,3,CTall ship replica to dock in
OL,4,CWhitehaven today
OL,6,F"We've always had the view that the
OL,7,Ftown could do with three permanent
OL,8,Ftourist attractions, you need just
OL,9,Fthat little bit of a tipping point to
OL,10,Fpull people over from the central
OL,11,FLakes."
OL,13,FWhitehaven has seen a number of tall
OL,14,Fships visit its harbour, including The
OL,15,FGaleon Andalucia, a 17th century
OL,16,FSpanish galleon replica which docked
OL,17,Fin Whitehaven in 2025.
OL,26,@wD@ErwwD@Ort
