PN,32904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785669498
OL,3,CTall ship replica to dock in
OL,4,CWhitehaven today
OL,6,FThe original Nao Santa Maria was one
OL,7,Fof the most significant vessels in
OL,8,Fhistory, playing the main role in the
OL,9,Fdiscovery of the Americas, making what
OL,10,Fwas then the world's longest and most
OL,11,Fdangerous voyage.
OL,13,FShe set off on 3 August 1492, arriving
OL,14,Fin America on 12 October that same
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FOn Christmas Day 1492 the ship was
OL,18,Fsailing near Espanola Island, in the
OL,19,FGalapagos Islands, when she ran
OL,20,Faground and was wrecked.
OL,26,@nD@[rtzD@RTw
