PN,32905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1785669498
OL,3,CTall ship replica to dock in
OL,4,CWhitehaven today
OL,6,FFrom her wreckage, the first Spanish
OL,7,Fsettlement in the Americas was built -
OL,8,F'Christmas Fort' in Bahia de Caracol,
OL,9,FHaiti.
OL,11,FWhitehaven residents and visitors will
OL,12,Fbe able to learn more about this
OL,13,Fhistory on board the 21st Century Nao
OL,14,FSanta Maria.
OL,16,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,17,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,18,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,19,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,20,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,21,Fbelow...
